{%- comment -%}
  fye-pdx-engage: everything after the buy decision on the redesigned
  product page (CRO handoff, 27/09/2026): the review strip, Wishlist and
  Share, Speak to us, and the offer box. Rendered by fye-pdx-ring and
  fye-pdx-stone, before their accordions.

  ── REVIEWS ONLY WHEN THEY ARE REAL ───────────────────────────────────────

  The handoff's "4.9 · 187 customer reviews" was placeholder data. Ed,
  27/09/2026: hide until real. So the strip renders from, in order:
    1. the product's own standard review metafields (reviews.rating and
       reviews.rating_count), which any review app writes; else
    2. the section's pdx_reviews_rating / _count / _quote / _url settings,
       for a store-wide figure such as Trustpilot; else
    3. nothing at all.
  No number is ever invented here.

  ── SHARE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  An inline ivory panel, not a popup. Links are built by fye-ui.js at the
  moment of the click, so the message carries the live summary line and the
  URL carries ?variant= and the chosen size where there is one. With JS off
  the panel stays closed and the button does nothing, which costs nothing.

  ── THE OFFER BOX ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  Ed, 27/09/2026: the returning-customer offer is 10%, not the handoff's 20%.
  The figure is a setting (pdx_offer_pct). Its button opens the product
  enquiry popup unless pdx_offer_link is set, because there is no offer page
  yet. The "That's £x off" line is painted by fye-ui.js from the live price
  and dropped under 560px, as the handoff's mobile copy is.

  "From FYE" in the handoff is rewritten "from us": FYE is Ed's own
  shorthand, not a name customers use (Ed, 25/09/2026).

  Parameters: product, settings, context ('form' on rings, 'card' on stones),
    noun ('ring' | 'diamond' | 'sapphire' …), offer ('ring' | 'stone'),
    is_plain, is_engagement, stone_words (stones: "0.31ct round"),
    offer_url (stones: the settings collection for this shape)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = settings
  assign p = product

  comment
    ── Reviews ──
  endcomment
  assign r_rating = ''
  assign r_count = ''
  assign r_quote = ''
  assign r_url = ''
  if p.metafields.reviews.rating.value != blank
    assign r_rating = p.metafields.reviews.rating.value.rating | round: 1
    assign r_count = p.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value
  elsif s.pdx_reviews_rating != blank
    assign r_rating = s.pdx_reviews_rating
    assign r_count = s.pdx_reviews_count
    assign r_quote = s.pdx_reviews_quote
    assign r_url = s.pdx_reviews_url
  endif

  comment
    ── Speak to us: numbers as read, links derived (as fye-popups does) ──
  endcomment
  assign phone = s.pdx_phone | default: '0208 178 6687'
  assign mobile = s.pdx_whatsapp | default: '07840 042922'
  assign tel = phone | remove: ' '
  assign tel_first = tel | slice: 0
  if tel_first == '0'
    assign tel = tel | remove_first: '0' | prepend: '+44'
  endif
  assign wa = mobile | remove: ' '
  assign wa_first = wa | slice: 0
  if wa_first == '0'
    assign wa = wa | remove_first: '0' | prepend: '44'
  endif
  assign wa = wa | remove: '+'

  if noun == 'bracelet'
    assign talk_copy = s.pdx_talk_copy | default: "Book a consultation in person in London or online. We'll help you choose the metal, the diamonds and the length, and answer any questions before you commit."
  elsif noun == 'ring'
    assign talk_copy = s.pdx_talk_copy | default: "Book a consultation in person in London or online. We'll help you choose the metal, the diamond and the size, and answer any questions before you commit."
  else
    assign talk_copy = s.pdx_talk_copy | default: "Book a consultation in person in London or online. We'll help you compare stones and choose the right setting."
  endif

  comment
    ── Offer ──
  endcomment
  assign pct = s.pdx_offer_pct | default: 10
  assign show_offer = true
  if pct == 0
    assign show_offer = false
  endif
  if offer == 'none'
    assign show_offer = false
  elsif offer == 'stone'
    assign offer_title = 'Want this ' | append: noun | append: ' set in a ring?'
    assign offer_line = 'Choose a handmade setting that suits a ' | append: stone_words | append: ' ' | append: noun | append: '.'
    assign offer_cta = 'Browse settings'
    assign offer_link = offer_url | default: s.setting_link | default: '/collections/engagement-rings'
    assign show_offer = true
  elsif is_engagement
    assign offer_title = 'Planning your wedding rings too?'
    assign offer_line = 'Buy your engagement ring from us and enjoy ' | append: pct | append: '% off your wedding rings.'
    assign offer_cta = 'How it works'
    assign offer_link = s.pdx_offer_link
  else
    if is_plain
      assign ring_words = 'this wedding ring'
    else
      assign ring_words = 'this ring'
    endif
    assign offer_title = 'Already bought your engagement ring from us?'
    assign offer_line = 'You may qualify for ' | append: pct | append: '% off ' | append: ring_words | append: '.'
    assign offer_cta = 'Claim your offer'
    assign offer_link = s.pdx_offer_link
    comment
      The popup states the claim in the shopper's own voice, so the enquiry
      reads as a claim rather than a question (Ed, 27/09/2026).
    endcomment
    assign claim_title = 'Claim your ' | append: pct | append: '% offer'
    assign claim_line = 'I bought my engagement ring from For Your Eternity and I would like to claim my ' | append: pct | append: '% off ' | append: ring_words | append: '.'
  endif
-%}

{%- if r_rating != blank -%}
  <div class="pdx__reviews">
    <p class="pdx__reviewhead">
      <span class="pdx__stars" aria-hidden="true">
        {%- for i in (1..5) -%}{%- render 'icon', name: 'star', size: 15 -%}{%- endfor -%}
      </span>
      <span class="pdx__rating">{{ r_rating }}</span>
      {%- if r_count != blank -%}
        <span class="pdx__ratingcount">· {{ r_count }} customer reviews</span>
      {%- endif -%}
      <span class="visually-hidden">Rated {{ r_rating }} out of 5</span>
      {%- if r_url != blank -%}
        <a class="pdx__textlink pdx__reviewlink" href="{{ r_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read all reviews ›</a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </p>
    {%- if r_quote != blank -%}
      <p class="pdx__reviewquote">“{{ r_quote }}”</p>
      <p class="pdx__reviewwho">Verified customer</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

<div class="pdx__sharewrap">
<div class="pdx__pair">
  {%- if context == 'form' -%}
    {%- render 'fye-wishlist-button', product: p, context: 'form', label: 'Add to wishlist' -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- render 'fye-wishlist-button', product: p, label: 'Add to wishlist' -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  <button type="button" class="pdx__sharebtn" data-pdx-share aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pdx-share-panel">
    {%- render 'icon', name: 'share', size: 16 -%}
    <span>Share this {{ noun }}</span>
  </button>
</div>

<div class="pdx__share" id="pdx-share-panel" data-pdx-share-panel hidden>
  <a class="pdx__shareto" href="#" data-pdx-share-to="email">{%- render 'icon', name: 'mail', size: 18 -%}<span>Email</span></a>
  <a class="pdx__shareto" href="#" data-pdx-share-to="whatsapp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{%- render 'icon', name: 'message', size: 18 -%}<span>WhatsApp</span></a>
  <a class="pdx__shareto" href="#" data-pdx-share-to="sms">{%- render 'icon', name: 'sms', size: 18 -%}<span>Text</span></a>
  <a class="pdx__shareto" href="#" data-pdx-share-to="facebook" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{%- render 'icon', name: 'facebook', size: 18 -%}<span>Facebook</span></a>
  <a class="pdx__shareto" href="#" data-pdx-share-to="pinterest" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{%- render 'icon', name: 'pinterest', size: 18 -%}<span>Pinterest</span></a>
  <button type="button" class="pdx__shareto" data-pdx-share-to="copy">{%- render 'icon', name: 'link', size: 18 -%}<span data-pdx-copy-label>Copy link</span></button>
</div>
</div>

<div class="pdx__talk">
  <p class="pdx__talkeyebrow">{{ s.pdx_talk_eyebrow | default: 'Prefer to talk it through?' }}</p>
  <h2 class="pdx__talktitle">{{ s.pdx_talk_heading | default: 'Speak to us' }}</h2>
  <p class="pdx__talkcopy">{{ talk_copy }}</p>
  <a class="btn btn--outline pdx__talkbtn" href="/pages/contact-us#popup-contact" data-fye-popup="pdx-enquire">Enquire about this {{ noun }}</a>
  <p class="pdx__talkways">
    <a href="tel:{{ tel }}">{{ phone }}</a>
    <a href="https://wa.me/{{ wa }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Message on WhatsApp<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
    <span>{{ s.pdx_hours | default: 'Mon–Fri, 9am–6pm' }}</span>
  </p>
</div>

{%- if show_offer -%}
  <div class="pdx__offer" data-pdx-offer>
    <div class="pdx__offertxt">
      <p class="pdx__offertitle">{{ offer_title }}</p>
      <p class="pdx__offerline">
        {{ offer_line }}
        {%- if offer == 'ring' and is_engagement == false %}
          <span class="pdx__offerextra" data-pdx-offer-extra hidden>That's <span data-pdx-offer-saving></span> off this ring.</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </p>
    </div>
    {%- if offer_link != blank -%}
      <a class="pdx__caps" href="{{ offer_link }}">{{ offer_cta }}</a>
    {%- else -%}
      <a class="pdx__caps" href="/pages/contact-us#popup-contact" data-fye-popup="pdx-enquire" data-pdx-enquire-topic="{{ offer_title | escape }}"
         {%- if claim_line != blank %} data-pdx-claim="{{ claim_line | escape }}" data-pdx-claim-title="{{ claim_title | escape }}"{% endif %}>{{ offer_cta }}</a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
